:: RobinTemple Secret Frenzy
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'lake_ruin'>><<set $bus to 'lake_ruin'>><<set $underwater to 0>><<set $oxygenRecovery to true>><<effects>>
<<if maplebirch.get('RobinTemple') and $RobinTemple.secret.rite_active and $RobinTemple.secret.rite_stage is 3>>
  <<garousal>>
  <<endevent>><<npc Robin 1>><<npc Sydney 2>><<person1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The violet goes back into the channels. The room takes a moment to decide how big it is, and settles on something too large.
      <br><br>
      You cannot tell whose hand is under yours. You know the three of you are near the middle, on the cushion, and you know that one hand is Robin's because it has stopped shaking, and one is Sydney's because it has not moved at all, and then you lose the thread between them and it does not come back. You answer a question nobody asked, and <span @class="'wraith-flicker ' + basicHypnoCss()">hear it answered in both their voices</span>.
      <br><br>
      Robin's mouth is against your shoulder and <<he>> is saying the words of <<his>> promise, or you are. Somebody is. The pull under your ribs answers twice, and the second answer arrives from the ceiling.
      <br><br>
      "I have you," Sydney says, close to your ear, and for one clear second <<nnpc_he 'Sydney'>> sounds exactly like <<nnpc_he 'Sydney'>>. Then the smell comes down again and takes the second away with it.
      <br><br>
      <span class='red'>You can still choose where this ends. The stone has not been given the last of the three names.</span>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      紫色退回沟槽。屋子花了一会儿才决定自己有多大，最后定在一个太大的尺寸上。
      <br><br>
      你分不出手底下是谁的手。你知道你们三人都在中间，在软垫上，也知道其中一只是罗宾的，因为它不抖了，另一只是悉尼的，因为它始终没动。然后你在两者之间丢了线头，再也没接回来。你回答了一个没人问的问题，还<span @class="'wraith-flicker ' + basicHypnoCss()">听见它被两个人的声音同时答完了</span>。
      <br><br>
      罗宾的嘴贴着你的肩膀，<<he>>在念<<his>>那份誓词的词句。也可能是你在念。总有人在念。你胸肋下的牵引答了两次，第二次是从天花板上下来的。
      <br><br>
      “我抓着你。”悉尼在你耳边说，有整整一秒，<<nnpc_he 'Sydney'>>听起来就是<<nnpc_he 'Sydney'>>本身。然后那股气味又下来，把那一秒带走了。
      <br><br>
      <span class='red'>你还来得及决定它在哪里结束。石头上那三个名字，还差最后一个没交出去。</span>
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<loveicon 'kiss'>><<lanLink ['Let all three names be answered (0:05)', '让三个名字都被回应 (0:05)'] 'RobinTemple Secret Sex'>><<if maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').secret.advance(4)>><<set $sexstart to 1>><<pass 5>><</if>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Take one name back and leave', '收回一个名字，离开'] 'RobinTemple Secret Abort'>><</lanLink>><br>
<<else>>
  <<include 'RobinTemple Secret Abort'>>
<</if>>

