        Robin lets <<nnpc_himself 'Robin'>> be put down, trembling in the cool air with flushed cheeks, fingers reluctantly slipping from your wrist. "I love you," <<nnpc_he 'Robin'>> whispers shakily, resting <<nnpc_his 'Robin'>> warm forehead against your shoulder for a lingering second before pulling back.
        <br><br>
        Sydney is already sitting up, though <<nnpc_his 'Sydney'>> chest rises and falls rapidly beneath <<nnpc_his 'Sydney'>> disheveled robes, a faint flush lingering at the line of <<nnpc_his 'Sydney'>> throat. "Neither of us did anything wrong," <<nnpc_he 'Sydney'>> says, <<nnpc_his 'Sydney'>> voice tighter and breathier than usual. "I would like to try again. Not tonight. I said I could wait, and I meant it."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        罗宾由着你把<<nnpc_him 'Robin'>>放下，夜风吹拂下浑身轻颤，两颊烧得通红，指尖恋恋不舍地从你的手腕滑落。“我爱你。”<<nnpc_he 'Robin'>>颤声低语，把滚烫的额头在你肩窝处依恋地蹭了片刻，才克制地收回动作。
        <br><br>
        悉尼已经坐了起来，尽管敞开的教袍下胸口仍在剧烈起伏，脖颈处还残留着未退的潮红。“我们都没做错什么。”<<nnpc_he 'Sydney'>>说着，嗓音比平时紧绷暗哑了几分，“我想再试一次。不是今晚。我说过我可以等，是认真的。”
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
  <br><br>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Sydney reaches for the folded clothes while Robin shields the light. You dress in the hollow above the bank, listening to the water below. Sydney looks towards the path. "Let's go home."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      悉尼去拿叠好的衣物，罗宾遮住灯光。你们在岸上方的凹地穿好衣服，听着下面的水声。悉尼看向小路。“回家吧。”
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<if _secretFinishedNow>><<storeon 'blasphemy'>><<clotheson>><<endcombat>><</if>>
  <<if _secretFinishedNow and !_secretCanContinue>><<run maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').secret.closeRite()>><</if>>
  <<if $oxygen lt $oxygenmax>><<set $oxygenRecovery to true>><</if>>
<</if>>
<<if $RobinTemple.secret.rite_active and $RobinTemple.secret.rite_stage is 4>>
  <<swimicon 'dive'>><<lanLink ['Go back down where the smell is coming from (0:05)', '顺气味再下一次水 (0:05)'] 'RobinTemple Secret Third'>><<if maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').secret.advance(5)>><<wateraction>><<set $oxygen -= 200>><<pass 5>><<hallucinogen 60>><<arousal 500>><</if>><</lanLink>><<loxygen>><br>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Stop here and leave together', '就此停手，一起离开'] 'RobinTemple Secret Abort'>><</lanLink>><br>
<<else>>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Stop here and go back up (0:10)', '就此停手，回到岸上 (0:10)'] 'RobinTemple Secret Aftermath'>><<run maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').secret.closeRite()>><<pass 10>><<endevent>><</lanLink>><br>
<</if>>

:: RobinTemple Secret Third
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'lake_ruin'>><<set $bus to 'lake_ruin'>><<set $underwater to 0>><<set $oxygenRecovery to true>><<effects>>
<<if maplebirch.get('RobinTemple') and $RobinTemple.secret.rite_active and $RobinTemple.secret.rite_stage is 5>>
  <<garousal>>
  <<endevent>><<npc Robin 1>><<npc Sydney 2>><<person1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The fissure is not where you left it. It is lower, and wider, and the smell is not coming down through it any more. It is coming up.
      <br><br>
      Robin goes first without being asked and does not look back to check that the rest of you are following. That is the first thing that is wrong with the evening. Sydney goes second and puts a hand on <<nnpc_his 'Sydney'>> own mouth on the way down, which is the second.
      <br><br>
      Nobody says the plan out loud. There is no plan. There is a warm violet light on the underside of the water and three people swimming towards it because it is warm.
      <br><br>
      You are not frightened. <span @class="'wraith-flicker ' + basicHypnoCss()">You would like to be able to say when that stopped.</span>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      裂隙不在你离开时的位置。它更低，也更宽，气味不再是从那里下来，而是从那里上去。
      <br><br>
      罗宾没有等人吩咐就先下去了，也没有回头确认你们跟不跟。这是今晚第一件不对劲的事。悉尼跟在第二，下潜时用手按住了自己的嘴，这是第二件。
      <br><br>
      谁也没有把打算说出来。根本没有打算。水面下方有一片温热的紫光，三个人朝它游过去，只因为它是温的。
      <br><br>
      你不害怕。<span @class="'wraith-flicker ' + basicHypnoCss()">你想说出自己是哪一刻开始不害怕的</span>，可你说不出来。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<loveicon 'kiss'>><<lanLink ['Reach the light (0:05)', '游到那片光里 (0:05)'] 'RobinTemple Secret Choir'>><<if maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').secret.advance(6)>><<wateraction>><<pass 5>><<hallucinogen 80>><<arousal 700>><</if>><</lanLink>><<loxygen>><br>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Pull Robin back up with you', '把罗宾一起拉回水面'] 'RobinTemple Secret Abort'>><</lanLink>><br>
<<else>>
  <<include 'RobinTemple Secret Abort'>>
<</if>>

:: RobinTemple Secret Choir
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'lake_ruin'>><<set $bus to 'lake_ruin'>><<set $underwater to 0>><<set $oxygenRecovery to true>><<effects>>
<<if maplebirch.get('RobinTemple') and $RobinTemple.secret.rite_active and $RobinTemple.secret.rite_stage is 6>>
  <<garousal>>
  <<endevent>><<npc Robin 1>><<npc Sydney 2>><<person1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The room is the same room. It has simply stopped pretending. The walls go up further than they should and the six windows are still there, six narrow ones, high, each with its own faint light behind it, and now you can hear that the light has a shape and the shape is a voice.
      <br><br>
      Three voices. Not the stone's imitation of yours, which was always half a breath late and always exactly what you were going to say. These are further away than that, and older, and they are not answering anyone. They are simply repeating the vow. Yours. Robin's. Sydney's. Over and over, in the order they were last spoken, and never once in the order you actually said them.
      <br><br>
      Robin kneels down in the middle without being told to and takes <<his>> robe off <<nnpc_himself 'Robin'>>, and <<he>> is calm about it, and that is not how Robin undresses. Sydney is already at the wall, one hand flat on the carving, saying <<nnpc_his 'Sydney'>> own name back to it in a low, level voice, testing it the way <<nnpc_he 'Sydney'>> tests a verse. Neither of them has looked at you since the light came up.
      <br><br>
      Nobody is holding anyone down. The three of you arranged yourselves, and you cannot remember doing it, and nobody is going to ask.
      <br><br>
      <span class='red'>This is the last place the stone can still be stopped. After this, it has all three names.</span>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      屋子还是那间屋子，只是不再假装了。墙比应该的高出许多，六扇窗还在那里，六扇窄窗，开得很高，每扇后面都有一点微光。而现在你听得出来，那光是有形状的，形状是声音。
      <br><br>
      三个声音。并非石头早先学你的那一套——那套把戏总是迟半口气，而且永远分毫不差地接上你正要吐出的下一句。眼前这三个声音要辽远得多，也苍老得多。它们不作回答，只是反复念诵着誓词。你的。罗宾的。悉尼的。一遍又一遍，依着它们最后一次被念出的顺序回荡，却从未按过你们真正起誓时的次序。
      <br><br>
      罗宾不用人吩咐，走到中间跪下来，把袍子从身上脱掉。<<he>>做得很平静——罗宾不是这样脱衣服的。悉尼已经贴在墙边，一只手按着雕纹，用很平的低声把自己的名字念回去，像在试一段唱词。自从光升起来，两个人都没有再看过你。
      <br><br>
      没有谁按着谁。是你们三个人自己排好位置的，而你想不起来是什么时候排的，也不会有人来问。
      <br><br>
      <span class='red'>这是石头还能被停下的最后一处。过了这里，三个名字就都归它了。</span>
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<loveicon 'kiss'>><<lanLink ['Answer for yourself this time (0:05)', '这一次自己回答 (0:05)'] 'RobinTemple Secret Madness'>><<if maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').secret.advance(7)>><<set $sexstart to 1>><<pass 5>><</if>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Say none of the three names', '三个名字都不念'] 'RobinTemple Secret Abort'>><</lanLink>><br>
<<else>>
  <<include 'RobinTemple Secret Abort'>>
<</if>>

:: RobinTemple Secret Madness
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'lake_ruin'>><<set $bus to 'lake_ruin'>><<set $underwater to 0>><<set $oxygenRecovery to true>><<effects>>
<<if maplebirch.get('RobinTemple') and $RobinTemple.secret.rite_active and $RobinTemple.secret.rite_stage is 7>>
  <<if $sexstart is 1>>
    <<set $sexstart to 0>>
    <<undress 'blasphemy'>>
    <<endevent>><<clearnpc>><<npc Robin 1>><<npc Sydney 2>><<person1>>
    <<consensual>><<set $consensual to 1>><<neutral 1>>
    <<maninit>><<npcexpose>>
    <<set $enemytrust += 900>>
    <<set $enemyarousalmax to 1400>>
    <<set $enemyno to 2>><<set $enemynomax to 2>>
    <<set $enemyanger to -20>>
    <<hallucinogen 50>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <span class="lewd">Robin does not wait for a hand on <<nnpc_him 'Robin'>> this time.</span> <<He>> comes across the floor to you and puts <<nnpc_his 'Robin'>> mouth against yours before you have decided anything, which <<he>> has never once done first, and the violet light goes on burning steady behind <<nnpc_his 'Robin'>> eyes.
        <br><br>
        <span class="lewd">Sydney takes <<nnpc_his 'Sydney'>> hand off the carving and takes your wrist instead, and <<nnpc_he 'Sydney'>> is not gentle about it either.</span>
        <br><br>
        <span class="lewd">"You said our names," <<nnpc_he 'Sydney'>> says, into your ear, level as ever. "It has them. I want what I was promised while it still means me."</span>
        <br><br>
        Three of you, and the windows, and the three voices still going in the ceiling in the wrong order. Somewhere behind you Robin is saying please, and you cannot tell whether <<nnpc_he 'Robin'>> is asking you to stop or to keep going, and neither can <<nnpc_he 'Robin'>>.
        <br><br>
        The violet comes back out of the channels, unhurried, and this time it knows the shape of the room and the shape of the three of you, and it does not wait to be offered.
        <br><br>
        All six windows answer at once, and the answer is the old one, the one written for a pair.
        <br>
        <span class="lustful">"As two, as one."</span>
        <br>
        <span class="lewd">"As two, as one."</span>
        <br>
        <span class="lustful">"Forever, as one."</span>
        <br>
        <span class="lewd">"Forever, as one."</span>
        <br><br>
        It is said for two, and it is said three times, and by the third time you cannot hold the count of who is present. Robin says your name and it arrives from the wall. Sydney is beside you and also standing at the stair.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <span class="lewd">这一次罗宾不等谁把手放上来。</span><<He>>自己从地上过来，在你还没决定任何事之前就把嘴贴上来——这是<<he>>从来没有先做过的事。紫光在<<nnpc_his 'Robin'>>眼底稳稳烧着。
        <br><br>
        <span class="lewd">悉尼把手从雕纹上收回来，改扣住你的手腕，也一点也不客气。“你念了我们的名字，”<<nnpc_he 'Sydney'>>贴着你耳朵说，语气照旧很平，“它拿到了。趁它还认得我，把我被答应过的东西给我。”</span>
        <br><br>
        三个人，六扇窗，顶上那三个声音还在用错误的顺序继续念。你身后罗宾在说“求你”，你分不出<<nnpc_he 'Robin'>>是要你停还是继续，<<nnpc_he 'Robin'>>自己也分不出。
        <br><br>
        紫色又从沟槽里出来，不慌不忙。这一次它认得屋子的形状，也认得你们三个人的形状，而且不再等人奉上。
        <br><br>
        六扇窗同时应了，应的是那一句旧的，写给两个人的那一句。
        <br>
        <span class="lustful">“如两者，如一体。”</span>
        <br>
        <span class="lewd">“如两者，如一体。”</span>
        <br>
        <span class="lustful">“永远，如一。”</span>
        <br>
        <span class="lewd">“永远，如一。”</span>
        <br><br>
        这话是给两个人写的，可它说了三遍。到第三遍，你已经数不清屋里到底有几个人。罗宾叫你的名字，声音从墙上过来。悉尼就在你身边，同时又站在断阶那边。
    <</language>>
    <br><br>
  <</if>>
  <<effects>><<effectsman>><<man>><<stateman>>
  <br><br>
  <<actionsman>>
  <<if _combatend>>
    <span id='next'><<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] 'RobinTemple Secret Aftermath'>><<if $combat is 1 and $enemytype is 'man'>><<if $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>><<ejaculation>><</if>><<run maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').secret.finish()>><<run maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').secret.closeRite()>><<endcombat>><<storeon 'blasphemy'>><<clotheson>><<set $enemyanger to 0>><<endevent>><<npc Robin 1>><<npc Sydney 2>><<person1>><</if>><</lanLink>></span><<nexttext>>
  <<else>>
    <span id='next'><<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] 'RobinTemple Secret Madness'>><</lanLink>></span><<nexttext>>
  <</if>>
<<else>>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the shore', '回到湖畔'] 'Lake Shore'>><</lanLink>><br>
<</if>>

:: RobinTemple Secret Aftermath
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to 'lake'>><<set $bus to 'lakeshore'>><<effects>><<lakeeffects>>
<<if !maplebirch.get('RobinTemple')>>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Walk back along the shore together (0:10)', '沿湖岸一起走回去 (0:10)'] 'Lake Shore'>><<pass 10>><<endevent>><</lanLink>><br>
<<elseif $RobinTemple.secret.stage is 'complete' and $RobinTemple.dual_promise>>
  <<endevent>><<npc Robin 1>><<npc Sydney 2>><<person1>>
  <<set _secretSettled to $RobinTemple.secret.rite_done>>
  <<if _secretSettled>>
    <<set $RobinTemple.secret.rite_done to false>>
    <<set $wraith.timer += 5>><<npcincr 'Ivory Wraith' lust 3>>
    <<awareness 12>>
    <<npcincr Robin trauma -1>>
    <<if !maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').secret.cornered>>
      <<npcincr Robin love 2>><<npcincr Robin lust 1>><<npcincr Sydney love 2>><<npcincr Sydney lust 1>>
    <</if>>
    <<if numberOfEarSlime()>><<set $earSlime.growth += 20>><<trauma 4>><<stress 8>><</if>>
  <</if>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You gather beneath the covered light. Robin holds your hand against <<his>> chest, waiting until <<his>> breath slows. <<if _secretSettled>><<lrtrauma>><<if !maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').secret.cornered>><<gglove 'Robin'>><<glust 'Robin'>><</if>><</if>> Sydney sits on the other side, drying the edge of the notebook with a sleeve. <<if !maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').secret.cornered>>When you say <<nnpc_his 'Sydney'>> name again, <<nnpc_he 'Sydney'>> takes your free hand and presses it to <<nnpc_his 'Sydney'>> lips. <<if _secretSettled>><<gglove 'Sydney'>><<glust 'Sydney'>><</if>><</if>>
      <br><br>
      "I heard you," Robin says. "At the end. I could still tell it was you." Sydney lays the notebook down. "We should write down what happened. Tomorrow. I don't want to get it wrong tonight."
      <br><br>
      <<if $RobinTemple.secret.rite_stage is 0 and !maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').secret.rushed>>
        The smell goes last. It lifts off the three of you somewhere on the path, all at once, the way a held note stops. Robin blinks and looks at <<his>> own hands. Sydney writes one word in the notebook, reads it, and crosses it out.
        <br><br>
        "Did I say the last part?" Robin asks. "The promise. The second one." <<He>> is asking both of you, and neither of you can answer, and <<he>> does not ask again.
        <br><br>
      <</if>>
      You speak each name again. Neither pull disappears when you turn to the other. <span @class="'wraith ' + basicHypnoCss()">You have gained Confounded Vow.</span> Robin notices you touch your chest. Sydney is doing the same. <<if _secretSettled>><<ggawareness>><</if>>
      <br><br>
      A ripple moves towards the bank against the current. You shift farther into the hollow. Something of the cold has followed you out.
      <<if numberOfEarSlime()>>
        <br><br>
        <<if maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').secret.unyielding>>
          The slime in your ear has not settled, but <span class='green'>your movements remain your own</span>. You press a hand over your ear and wait for the ache to pass.
        <<else>>
          The slime in your ear has not settled. You press a hand over it and wait for the ache to pass.
        <</if>> <<if _secretSettled>><<gtrauma>><<gstress>><</if>>
      <</if>>
      <br><br>
      <<if maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').secret.rushed>>
        <<if maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').secret.cornered>>Robin looks towards the path. "Can we go now?" You point out the dry ground. Sydney puts the notebook away without opening it. "Tomorrow, you tell me exactly what you knew. Not what you thought would happen."<<else>>Robin repeats the familiar words quietly. Sydney leaves the notebook shut. "We went further than we planned. I want to read this again in daylight."<</if>> You stay until both are ready to walk.
      <<else>>
        Robin asks whether you will eat together tomorrow. Sydney looks up from the page. "I want a seat beside you too." You agree to have a meal with them tomorrow.
      <</if>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你们聚到遮光灯下。罗宾把你的手按在胸前，等呼吸缓下来。<<if _secretSettled>><<lrtrauma>><<if !maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').secret.cornered>><<gglove 'Robin'>><<glust 'Robin'>><</if>><</if>>悉尼坐在另一边，用袖口擦干笔记的边角。<<if !maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').secret.cornered>>你再次念出<<nnpc_his 'Sydney'>>名字时，<<nnpc_he 'Sydney'>>握住你空着的那只手，轻轻吻了吻。<<if _secretSettled>><<gglove 'Sydney'>><<glust 'Sydney'>><</if>><</if>>
      <br><br>
      “我听见你了。”罗宾说，“最后的时候，我还能听出是你。”悉尼放下笔记。“该把发生的事记下来。明天吧。我不想今晚记错。”
      <br><br>
      <<if $RobinTemple.secret.rite_stage is 0 and !maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').secret.rushed>>
        气味是最后走的。它在半路上一下子离开你们三个人，就像一段被按住的长音忽然松开。罗宾眨眨眼，低头看自己的手。悉尼在笔记上写了一个词，读了读，划掉。
        <br><br>
        “最后那段是我说的吗？”罗宾问，“后来那份承诺。”<<He>>问的是你们两个，而你们两个都答不上来。<<he>>没有再问。
        <br><br>
      <</if>>
      你再分别念出两人的名字。转向另一个人时，原来的牵引没有消失。<span @class="'wraith ' + basicHypnoCss()">你获得了混乱誓约。</span>罗宾看见你按住胸口，悉尼也正做着同样的动作。<<if _secretSettled>><<ggawareness>><</if>>
      <br><br>
      一道涟漪逆着水流靠向湖岸。你往凹地里面挪了挪，有一部分寒意跟着你出来了。
      <<if numberOfEarSlime()>>
        <br><br>
        <<if maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').secret.unyielding>>
          耳中的史莱姆还没有安静，<span class='green'>身体仍由你自己控制</span>。你用手盖住耳朵，等那阵疼过去。
        <<else>>
          耳中的史莱姆还没有安静。你用手盖住耳朵，等那阵疼过去。
        <</if>><<if _secretSettled>><<gtrauma>><<gstress>><</if>>
      <</if>>
      <br><br>
      <<if maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').secret.rushed>>
        <<if maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').secret.cornered>>罗宾望向小路。“现在能走了吗？”你指出干燥的地面。悉尼没有翻开笔记，直接把它收好。“明天，你告诉我，你到底知道什么。不是你以为会怎样。”<<else>>罗宾小声重复着熟悉的誓词，悉尼把笔记合着放在身边。“今晚比原先打算的多走了很远。我想白天再看看这些。”<</if>>你等到两人都能起身走路。
      <<else>>
        罗宾问，明天能不能一起吃饭。悉尼从书页上抬起眼。“我也要坐你旁边。”你答应明天和两人一起吃饭。
      <</if>>
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<if !maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').secret.threatened and !maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').secret.rushed>>
    <<loveicon 'hug'>><<lanLink ['Be intimate with both companions again', '再与两人亲热一会儿'] 'RobinTemple Secret Sex'>><<set $sexstart to 1>><</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Walk back along the shore together (0:10)', '沿湖岸一起走回去 (0:10)'] 'Lake Shore'>><<pass 10>><<endevent>><</lanLink>><br>
<<else>>
  <<include 'RobinTemple Secret Abort'>>
<</if>>

:: RobinTemple Secret Abort
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to 'lake'>><<set $bus to 'lakeshore'>><<set $underwater to 0>><<set $oxygenRecovery to true>><<effects>><<lakeeffects>>
<<set _secretStage to $RobinTemple.secret.stage>>
<<set _secretLie to ['decision', 'ritual'].includes(_secretStage) and $RobinTemple.secret.appeal is 'danger' and $RobinTemple.secret.persuaded and [$RobinTemple.secret.night, $RobinTemple.secret.night + 1].includes($RobinTemple.secret.witness_day)>>
<<set _secretCaught to _secretStage is 'decision' and $RobinTemple.secret.appeal and !$RobinTemple.secret.persuaded>>
<<set _secretThreatened to maplebirch.get('RobinTemple')?.secret.threatened ?? Boolean($possessed or $wraith?.hunt gt 0 or $foresthunt gt 0 or $wraith?.state is 'haunt' or $wraith?.offspring is 'dead' or (C.npc['Ivory Wraith']?.lust ?? 0) gte 20 or ($wraith?.timer ?? 0) gte 10)>>
<<if _secretLie>><<npcincr Robin love -3>><<npcincr Sydney love -3>><<npcincr Robin trauma -1>><</if>>
<<if ['travelling', 'decision', 'ritual'].includes(_secretStage)>>
  <<set $RobinTemple.secret.stage to 'research'>><<set $RobinTemple.secret.trial to ''>>
  <<set $RobinTemple.secret.robin_day to -1>><<set $RobinTemple.secret.sydney_day to -1>><<set $RobinTemple.secret.prepared to false>>
<</if>>
<<set $RobinTemple.secret.rite_active to false>><<set $RobinTemple.secret.rite_stage to 0>>
<<if _secretStage is 'ritual'>>
  <<set $underwater to 0>><<set $oxygenRecovery to true>>
  <<storeon 'blasphemy'>><<clotheson>>
<</if>>
<<endevent>><<npc Robin 1>><<npc Sydney 2>><<person1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <<if _secretLie>>
      You admit that the passage is still open. Sydney goes first, testing the turns you marked before. Once ashore, Robin takes a steadier breath and lets go of your hand. "You said we couldn't leave." <<lrtrauma>><<llllove 'Robin'>> Sydney keeps the notebook closed. "You didn't know. Next time, say that." <<llllove 'Sydney'>>
    <<elseif _secretCaught>>
      You swim back with them. Robin stays close to Sydney on the bank. Neither wants to hear more about the stone tonight.
    <<elseif _secretStage is 'ritual'>>
      Robin lets go of the stone. "Not this way," <<he>> says. Sydney turns towards the passage you came through. "Stay with us." You leave the unfinished words behind and swim back together.
    <<else>>
      You put the route notes away. Robin waits beside you while Sydney checks the path towards the road. "Another time," Robin says, quietly. "We can go home together, can't we?"
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    <span class='teal'>Your investigation notes are kept. Before leaving again, ask each companion for agreement and allow time to think.</span>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<if _secretLie>>
      你承认，通道其实仍然敞着。悉尼先下水，沿着事先标出的转角试路。上岸后，罗宾呼吸稳了些，松开你的手。“你说我们走不了。”<<lrtrauma>><<llllove 'Robin'>>悉尼没有翻开笔记。“你不知道。下次，就说不知道。”<<llllove 'Sydney'>>
    <<elseif _secretCaught>>
      你和两人一起游回去。到了岸上，罗宾待在悉尼身旁。今晚，两人都不想再听石头的事。
    <<elseif _secretStage is 'ritual'>>
      罗宾从石头上收回手。“不能是这样。”<<he>>说。悉尼转向来时的通道。“跟紧我们。”你们把没念完的话留在身后，一起游回岸边。
    <<else>>
      你收好路线笔记。罗宾在你身边等着，悉尼看看通向道路的小径。“下次吧。”罗宾轻声说，“我们可以一起回去，对吧？”
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    <span class='teal'>调查记录仍然保留。下次出发前，需要重新征求两人的同意，并留出考虑的时间。</span>
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<if _secretThreatened>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <span class='red'>You cannot bring them farther into the pursuit.</span> Robin and Sydney take the marked path towards the road while you turn back towards the presence following you.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <span class='red'>你不能把两人再带进追猎深处。</span>罗宾和悉尼沿标好的路退向道路，你转身面对尾随的存在。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<if !$possessed and $wraith.state and npcCanHunt('Ivory Wraith')>>
    <<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to 'lake'>><<set $bus to 'lakeshore'>>
    <<if $wraith.hunt gt 0>><<destinationlake>><<else>><<wHunt 'lake'>><</if>>
  <<else>>
    <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to shore', '回到湖畔'] 'Lake Shore'>><<endevent>><</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
<<else>>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to shore together (0:10)', '一起回到湖畔 (0:10)'] 'Lake Shore'>><<pass 10>><<endevent>><</lanLink>><br>
<</if>>
